Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:41:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: add GitHub Actions workflows

- ci.yml: Rust fmt/clippy/tests, Dart analyze/format/tests and a quick
  benchmark on Linux x64/arm64, macOS and Windows, native cross builds and
  Flutter example builds for Android, iOS, macOS, Linux and Windows
- native-build.yml: reusable matrix for all 13 native targets
- release.yml: prebuilt native libraries on v* tags
- benchmark.yml: weekly / manual full benchmark run
- dependabot.yml

